  "description": "Typed, read/write JSON configuration for .NET — the writable alternative to Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration. Register a JSON file bound to a plain settings class, inject a typed IConfig<T> through dependency injection, read through Value, and persist changes back to the same file with WriteAsync. Grouping is expressed with nested C# properties, so there are no \"Section:Key\" strings anywhere. Writes are atomic, validation (DataAnnotations attributes plus an in-library fluent validator) reports every failure at once and always runs before a write, and the library ships its own configuration model — it never touches IConfiguration.",
  "id": "Enigma.Configuration",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-27T10:59:20.093Z",
  "licenseFile": "LICENSE.md",
  "licenseUrl": "https://aka.ms/deprecateLicenseUrl",
